DESCRIPTION:CTF Event from CTFTime\n\nFormat: Jeopardy\n\nTHEM?!CTF 2026 is
  an online\, worldwide jeopardy-style Capture The Flag competition organize
 d by THEM?!\n\nJoin our discord server btw: https://discord.gg/its-them\n\n
 The event is designed to be beginner-friendly while still offering enough d
 epth for intermediate and experienced players. Challenges will span a wide 
 range of difficulty levels\, so newer players can learn and participate/slo
 p\, while stronger teams can expect harder problems that require deeper tec
 hnical skill actual brain functioning.\n\nWe plan to feature 40+ challenges
  across the following categories:\n\nCrypto\, Web\, Reverse\, Pwn\, Web3\, 
 OSINT\, Forensics\, and Misc\n\nFor THEM?!CTF we put a lot of effort into o
 riginal yet interesting challenge design. We are paying special attention t
 o reducing low-effort solving aka. slopping and flag-sharing through very i
 ntentional challenge design choices\, with the goal of making the event fun
  and more competitive for everyone.\n\nSharing flags\, solutions\, or even 
 the slightest hint is STRICTLY forbidden\, and will NOT be tolerated.\n\nTh
 e use AI is not forbidden\, since it cannot be reliably proven\, but relyin
 g on it too much tends to be embarrassingly obvious. \n\nSlopping will resu
 lt in a ban.\n\nThe event is fully online and open to players worldwide.\nT
 here is no team size limit.\n\n\nWe wish all players and teams best of luck
 .\n\n\nBig thanks to our sponsors: \nGoogle Cloud cloud.google.com\nKenshi 
 Security kenshisecurity.com\nNordVPN nordvpn.com\nNordPass nordpass.com\nIn
 cogni incogni.com\nSaily saily.com\nNexos AI nexos.ai\n\nMore info: https:/
 /themctf.com/
